    "details": "https://github.com/erlang/otp/security/advisories/GHSA-pv7g-pjrq-x2fh\nreports:\n\n> The SSH SFTP daemon\\'s handling of SSH_FXP_READLINK returned symbolic\n> link targets containing the server\\'s absolute filesystem path,\n> disclosing the backend root prefix to clients. The handler now strips\n> the backend root prefix from symlink targets before returning them.\n",
